# The trained model itself is a regeneratable binary blob (`python -m
# ml.train_risk_classifier` rebuilds it from ml/data/, which IS
# committed) -- keeping it out of git avoids diffing a binary file for
# no benefit. ml/data/*.jsonl and ml/artifacts/results.json are
# committed on purpose: they're what makes docs/ml_experiment.md's
# numbers directly reproducible/inspectable, not just asserted.
ml/artifacts/*.joblib
